{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7680375795693488393","title":"供应链采购专员","description":"1、负责手机原材料采购履行工作，包含：物料需求管理，订单释放，提货计划管理，订单准确交付，退补货管理等，达成采购任务各项指标。\n2、参与库存策略的制定，负责提高原材料库存周转率，降低库存金额。\n3.负责推动解决项目开发和量产过程的物料交付问题点，确保保质保量有序交付。\n4、负责分析需求、市场、行业、周期性、地域性、长周期等交付相关风险，制定预防和规避措施，并组织制定备料策略。\n5、负责管理供应商资源准备情况，生产状态，交付流程等，每月对供应商进行合理评价。\n6、每个季度主导开展QBR，推动双方合作模式不断优化。\n7、参与公司集成供应链体系建设与优化。","requirement":"1、大学本科及以上学历，理工科专业优先（电子、材料、机械、数学、工业工程）；\n2、具备良好的沟通协调能力，较强的组织能力和高效执行力；\n3、符合小米价值观，真诚热爱，坚韧乐观，责任心强。","city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1788227118415,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178743792710893677","name":"供应链类","en_name":"Supply Chain","i18n_name":"供应链类"},"job_id":"7680375795693357321","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDC